    "harness": "Consolidate identical21independent assertions plus recovery-after-each into one session and retain separate complete-fixture/native-profile tests. Two superseded23startup development runs were explicitly terminated; no pass claimed. Initial Result comparison in the consolidated Rust harness failed to compile because RSessionError has no PartialEq; use matches! with unchanged expected output."
